Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS Desktop session
 The FosOS panel, Start menu, desktop, Files, Terminal, Notepad, Photos, Videos, Store,
 Task Manager, Device Manager, Remote Desktop client, notifications, lock screen,
 LightDM greeter and settings shell, running on the Openbox window manager. It is the default
 login session. A minimal FosOS Recovery session and text consoles are the
 fallback when the shell fails. SSH server is on by default; inbound RDP uses
 xrdp for a separate FosOS Desktop session (Settings → Remote Desktop).
